<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · site</p><h1 class="enc-title">Columbia University</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Columbia University is a private research university in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-york">New York</a> City, founded in 1754. It has been a major centre for the study of Japanese history and culture. The site mentions it in connection with scholarship on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/empire-of-japan">Empire of Japan</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/columbia-university.jpg" alt="Columbia University" width="320" height="417" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Hstoops · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coat_of_Arms_of_Columbia_University.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
